# WorkBuddy workspace: the ops tooling is worth versioning, but these must
# never be published. `.workbuddy/backups/` holds the server archive, which
# embeds the reality private key and the client UUIDs; `.workbuddy/memory/`
# is the internal work log and carries host and IP details of the deployment;
# `tmp/` is scratch and `engine-matrix/` is regenerable build output.
.workbuddy/backups/
.workbuddy/memory/
.workbuddy/tmp/
.workbuddy/tools/engine-matrix/
.workbuddy/tools/vps_matrix_check.sh
.workbuddy/tools/vps_tgbot_check.sh
